            <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><span>Diensthaftpflicht inkl. Schlüssel &amp; Ausrüstung</span></li>
            <li><span class="tick"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg></span><span>Straf- &amp; Dienstrechtsschutz für den Außendienst</span></li>
